OL,3,GNEWSAAir ambulance 'pivotal' in saving
OL,4,Agolfer's life
OL,5,
OL,6,FA golfer whose heart stopped for two
OL,7,Fminutes while out on the course has
OL,8,Fpraised the air ambulance crew he says
OL,9,Fhelped save his life.
OL,11,FAndy Wilkins, 62, was playing a round
OL,12,Fat Cleethorpes Golf Club in July 2025
OL,13,Fwhen he noticed a pain in his chest. By
OL,14,Fthe time he reached the end of the
OL,15,Ffairway, the pain had become
OL,16,Foverwhelming and he went into cardiac
OL,17,Farrest.
OL,19,FHis friends called 999 and he was taken
OL,20,Fby Lincs & Notts Air Ambulance to
OL,21,Fhospital.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
