OL,3,GNEWSAAir ambulance 'pivotal' in saving
OL,4,Agolfer's life
OL,5,
OL,6,F"There were lots of people who saved my
OL,7,Flife that day but, without a doubt, the
OL,8,Fair ambulance was pivotal in saving me.
OL,9,FI wouldn't be here without them," he
OL,10,Fsaid.
